</details><details class="declaration" id="decl-autosamplingtheory-technicallemmas-functionalinequalities-bernoullilogso-b6d24c48e2">
  <summary><span class="kind">theorem</span> <code>AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.BernoulliLogSobolev.bernoulli_integral_eq_sum</code> <span class="status status-yellow">Partial</span> <span class="status status-gray">Not mapped</span></summary>
  <div class="declaration-content">
    <p class="muted">No declaration docstring.</p>
    <pre class="code-block"><code class="language-lean">private theorem bernoulli_integral_eq_sum {n : ℕ} (f : (Fin n → Bool) → ℝ) :
    ∫ ε, f ε ∂(bernoulliUniform n) = (∑ ε : Fin n → Bool, f ε) / 2^n := by
