    <p class="source-links"><a href="../modules/autosamplingtheory-technicallemmas-functionalinequalities-bernoullilogsobolev.html#complete-module-source">AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/FunctionalInequalities/BernoulliLogSobolev.lean:89</a><span>local preview source</span></p>
    
